            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Anirban saw a few tennis balls lying around. He wondered, “How many tennis balls can fit in an empty classroom?”. The classroom is of dimensions 30 ft × 30 ft × 15 ft. Estimate how many tennis balls of radius 3 cm fit in this classroom. Before calculating, make a guess."
